# Wauvio voice profile. Every value is explicit; edit and load with load_profile().
voice reiha
display Reiha (玲羽)
language ja
notes Cool, crystalline, airy: delicate, precise, slightly breathy, clear highs; detached and fragile rather than warm.
natural_amount 0.5

# model
model_name Reiha: cool, crystalline Japanese female
